# Every tracked file in this repository is stored LF, and fail-closed checks
# hash file bytes at runtime. A CRLF working tree therefore changes governed
# fingerprints even when the committed blob is identical.
#
# Pin the repository to LF so hosted-bridge and onboarding fingerprint inputs
# materialize deterministically on every platform. The companion regression
# test asserts Git's resolved attribute policy rather than Linux checkout
# behavior, so removing or weakening this line fails CI.
* text=auto eol=lf
